      <mxCell id="note" value="⚠ Holder-name validation note
Razorpay IFSC API does NOT return account-holder name.
Today: applicant types name → Opus reads name on cheque → fuzzy match.
Catches obvious mismatches (wrong cheque uploaded). Does NOT confirm
name belongs to that account at the bank.
Production gap: add penny-drop / bank-account verification API
(e.g. Razorpay Bank Account Verification) for true name↔account binding." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
